config C5_SOUNDWIRE_CORE
	bool "C5 isolated legacy SoundWire bus core"
	depends on ARM64 && OF && C5_RECOVERY_ONLY && !MODULES
	depends on !SOUNDWIRE && !SOUNDWIRE_WCD_CTRL
	default n
	help
	  Restore the old SoundWire bus/root and callable core API on the fixed
	  C5 source profile. This does not select a controller, codec, regmap,
	  device-tree node or hardware operation. Legacy global SOUNDWIRE and
	  SOUNDWIRE_WCD_CTRL must stay off to ensure one provider. No defaults
	  or current profile are changed by this opt-in source candidate.
